provenance.prompt:
Create an original 1536×1024 true-transparent RGBA sprite sheet for JAMVERSE '96. Use the supplied Leo gameplay sprite only as identity and arcade pixel-art style reference. Draw exactly fifteen distinct complete full-body Leo poses in a strict five-column by three-row grid, row-major, broad gutters and outer margins. Keep long hair, fingers and shoes safely inside each cell at consistent scale and camera. Crisp readable 1990s arcade pixel clusters and dark outlines.

Leo is the pale aristocratic adult man and captain of the Blackthorn Court Kings. Preserve pale skin, long wavy black hair, refined mustache, composed handsome face, natural adult human anatomy and controlled poise. He wears a tailored black basketball uniform with restrained crimson accents, matching shorts and shoes. Exactly two arms, two hands, two legs and two shoes. No fangs, horns, cape, robe, monster traits, extra limbs, costume change or props.

This is a right-facing one-hand windmill dunk. The basketball is separately rendered game art and is never drawn. Both hands stay visibly empty in all poses. No ball, sphere, orb, seams, court, hoop, rim, floor, shadow, background, glow, border, grid, text, teammate or opponent. Exterior and gutters are genuine alpha-zero transparency, without checkerboard, matte, speckles or haze.

Fifteen sequential original poses with a clear low windmill orbit and one release:
0 right-facing approach, eyes on the rim;
1 gathers the invisible ball near the right hip;
2 plants and coils, right arm starts a large circular sweep;
3 jumps, right arm swings down and behind the hip;
4 turns his shoulders as the empty hand circles behind his back;
5 sweeps the hand low beneath the waist, knees tucked;
6 continues the circle around the far side of the torso;
7 torso rotates back toward image-right, hand rises behind the shoulder;
8 right elbow lifts beside and behind the head;
9 completes the windmill arc overhead, body fully extended;
10 RELEASE at simulation tick21: right hand opens through the imaginary rim, fully empty, left arm balances;
11 empty-handed follow-through travels down and forward;
12 descends, shoulders unwind toward image-right;
13 lands softly with knees bent;
14 recovers to a poised ready stance.

Keep Leo right-facing overall and preserve his pale human face, long wavy hair, refined mustache, black/crimson kit and complete shoes. Distinguish the windmill circle from a straight power dunk, tomahawk, reverse or 360. No ball in the artwork. Return only the transparent sprite sheet.
